  "description": {
   "en": "Helena is a normal student, with good grades and a planned future, it has been like this all her life, until one fateful night, a demonic creature saves her from an unfortunate event and her world is turned upside down. Will Wangari be able to adapt in the human world? The Draconian has many secrets, will Helena be able to unravel them? Follow this beautiful romance between girls and unravel the magic mysteries surrounding Don't Look at The Sky",
   "es-la": "Helena es una estudiante normal, con buenas notas y un futuro planificado, ha sido así toda su vida, hasta que una fatídica noche, una criatura demoníaca la salva de un desafortunado suceso y su mundo se pone patas arriba. ¿Podrá Wangari adaptarse en el mundo humano? La Draconiana tiene muchos secretos, ¿podrá Helena desentrañarlos? Sigue este hermoso romance entre chicas y desentraña los mágicos misterios que rodean a Don't Look at The Sky"
  },
